  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "de-Broglie wavelength,\n$\\lambda=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{p}=\\frac{h}{\\sqrt{2 \\cdot m \\cdot(K \\cdot E)}} \\quad \\therefore \\lambda \\propto \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{K \\cdot E}}$\nIf K.E is doubled, $\\lambda$ becomes $\\frac{\\lambda}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
